    "preamble": "Jitendra Singh Dangi vs The State Of Madhya Pradesh on 15 December, 2021 Author: Anil Verma Bench: Anil Verma High Court Of Madhya Pradesh 1 Crr No.3004/2021 Crr No.3004/2021 (Jitendra Singh Dangi Vs. State of M.P.) Indore, Dated : 15.12.2021",
    "facts": "Also heard on IA No.28553/2021, which is an application for suspension of sentence filed by applicant Jitendra Singh Dangi.",
    "arguments": "Learned counsel for the applicant submits that applicant has been convicted under Section 7(1) read with Section 16(1) (a)(1) of the Prevention of Food Adulteration Act and sentenced to six months R.I. with fine. He further submits that the applicant has remained on bail during trial and he did not misuse the [LEAKAGE_MASK] to him and that final conclusion of this revision will take long sufficient time.",
